flowchart TD
    %% =========================================================================
    %% JRR TRANSPORT SYSTEM — MODULE 15: SELF-SIGNUP, EMAIL OTP & APPROVAL
    %% =========================================================================

    Start([Start: Prospective User visits signup_page.html]) --> In_RegData[/Input: Username, First Name, Last Name, Work Email, Security Password/]
    In_RegData --> ClickRegister[Action: Click 'Complete Registration']
    ClickRegister --> Sub_SupaSignUp[[Predefined Process: Supabase Auth signUp]]

    Sub_SupaSignUp --> Dec_EmailUnique{Decision: Email Not Already in auth.users?}
    Dec_EmailUnique -- No --> Out_ErrMail[/Display Error: 'An account with this email already exists'/] --> In_RegData

    Dec_EmailUnique -- Yes --> SendOTP[Action: Supabase Dispatches 6-Digit Verification Code to Work Email]
    SendOTP --> SwitchStep2[Action: UI Transitions to Step 2: Verification Panel]

    SwitchStep2 --> RenderCodeInputs[/Display 6-Digit OTP Box Array on Screen/]
    RenderCodeInputs --> In_Code[/Input: User Enters 6-Digit Code digits [0-5]/]
    In_Code --> ClickVerify[Action: Click 'Verify Email' / Supabase verifyOtp]

    ClickVerify --> Dec_CodeValid{Decision: 6-Digit Code Matches & Not Expired?}
    Dec_CodeValid -- No --> Out_ErrCode[/Display Error: 'Invalid or expired verification code'/] --> RenderCodeInputs

    Dec_CodeValid -- Yes --> WriteVerified[(Database: Mark Email Verified in Supabase Auth)]
    WriteVerified --> SetPendingState[(Database: Set User Account status = 'pending_approval')]

    SetPendingState --> SwitchStep3[Action: UI Transitions to Step 3: Pending Approval Panel]
    SwitchStep3 --> Out_PendingNotice[/Display Notice: 'Email Verified! Account Pending Admin Approval'/]

    Out_PendingNotice --> Off_ToAdminApproval>["OFF-PAGE: To Module 17\nAdmin Panel for Approval / Rejection"]

    %% Admin Decision Flow
    Off_ToAdminApproval --> AdminReview[Action: Super Admin inspects user details on admin_panel.html]
    AdminReview --> Dec_AdminDecision{Decision: Admin Action?}

    Dec_AdminDecision -- Reject / Ban --> Sub_Ban[[Predefined Process: Delete Auth User]]
    Sub_Ban --> Out_RejectedNotice[/Account Deleted / Denied/]

    Dec_AdminDecision -- Approve --> Sub_Approve[[Predefined Process: UPDATE users / employees SET status = 'active']]
    Sub_Approve --> WriteActive[(Database: Account Activated & Assigned Role)]
    WriteActive --> Off_ToLogin>["OFF-PAGE: To Module 01\nUser Now Authorized to Log In (index.html)"]

    %% Hyperlinks
    click Off_ToAdminApproval "./17_admin_audit_and_health.mmd" "Open Module 17: Admin Audit & Health"
    click Off_ToLogin "./01_auth_and_session.mmd" "Open Module 01: Auth & Session"
